Revision history for getty-bun

{{$NEXT}}
  - POSIX starter bootstrap/getty-bun.sh with run, ensure and status:
    installs the pinned Bun on demand under a lock, then runs the given
    command on it. An empty installed executable counts as a broken
    install and is replaced; curl and wget ignore the user's rc files.
  - Windows starter bootstrap/getty-bun.ps1 for Windows PowerShell 5.1 and
    PowerShell 7, with the same commands and exit codes as the POSIX
    starter.
  - Version table (bootstrap/versions.json) pins Bun 1.4.5 with SHA256
    checksums for five targets; render-pin.ts writes the pin block into
    the starters.
  - Shared scenario suite (bootstrap/test) runs the starter against a
    local fixture server with an isolated GETTY_HOME.
